   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> »titan« becomes a groundbreaking 3D pioneer </h1>",
   "body": "<p>With »3dCheck«, the perfect inspection machine for fast, process-oriented and fully automatic digitization of tool geometries, you can measure without contact - without damaging the tools.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3636\">3D target/actual comparison</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3637\">3D analysis</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3638\">2D analysis</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/c/csm_anwendung_3dpionier_en_c9bd79a902.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1200,
     "h": 1200
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1500",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "none"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/e/csm_topographie_en_b73f3b042f.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 589
   },
   "title": "3D target/actual comparison",
   "text": "<p>With color coding and weighting of geometric deviations across the entire tool surface. This enables faster and targeted intervention in the production process.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3636",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/0/csm_3D-analyse_de_bed5e1c93b.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 589
   },
   "title": "3D analysis",
   "text": "<p>The scanned tool contour with the option of inserting defined sectional planes for further detailed 2D analysis. The 3D measurement data can be exported in the standard .stl format for further processing in the customer's own CAD system.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3637",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/7/csm_2D-analyse_de_ac39ea6b3b.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 589
   },
   "title": "2D analysis",
   "text": "<p>Shows the defined cutting plane as a 2D contour and enables a target/actual comparison with color coding and weighting of deviations. Additional measurements can be carried out on the 2D contour for further analysis.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3638",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Intelligent 24/7 presence </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>ZOLLER »roboSet 2« - automates your »titan«. Cleans, loads, labels and organizes your tools completely without manpower.</strong></p> <p><strong>All measurements are fully documented. After measuring, the tools are marked with ZOLLER »roboMark« - a laser flexibly marks the shank of the tool within milliseconds with values and other data individually determined during the measuring process.</strong></p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/products/automation/tool-inspection/roboset-2\">More about »roboSet 2«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/2/csm_titan_roboset2_6f7b12a8e2.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1193
    }
   ],
